    {
      "id": "claim_3fc225bb08284ca69982e26e9c556651",
      "statement": "The runtime passes `store`, `policy_docs`, `tools`, `model`, and `policy_checker` through `AgentContext` as per-invocation collaborators, keeping live clients and other non-serializable objects out of checkpointed graph state.",
