    {
      "id": "claim_66807fe229034ce1b3ea73346c94a3c4",
      "statement": "`invoke` returns a compact result object with `application_id`, the graph's final `outcome`, a `decision_uri`, and stage-specific URIs for any completed stages under the identity-derived `s3://<bucket>/<customer_id>/<application_id>` prefix; the graph also persists stage artifacts such as `financial_assessment/result.json` and `decision/result.json` under the same prefix.",
      "evidence": [
