      "id": "claim_9aad999b04dd4a8bb4d3af9ff8da6cc3",
      "statement": "The runtime and gateway boundary assumes short-lived credentials, on-demand MCP tool loading, Secrets Manager for the client secret, and caller-independent checkpoint scoping; changing those assumptions would weaken the system's auth and resume guarantees.",
